{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121169","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121169/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121169/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121169/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121169","id":4855926661,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7wNpFj","number":121169,"title":"Vulkan: Disable MSAA discardable flag to prevent DMA page fault","user":{"login":"PateevK","id":171885206,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj7Clg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171885206?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK","html_url":"https://github.com/PateevK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-10T14:32:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T13:19:51Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T13:18:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121169","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121169","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121169.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121169.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120637 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<b>Root Cause:</b> NVIDIA Nsight Aftermath reports_DMA_PageFault Error with the hardware error string: MMU fault detected during a GPU memory access. The failure consistently triggers during a downstream buffer-to-buffer copy (vkCmdCopyBuffer) inside RenderingDeviceDriverVulkan, when `rd_color_multisample_format.is_discardable = true;` on NVIDIA GPU.\r\n\r\nI found that reverting commit 3cf0881c36 also prevents the crash. However, doing a pure revert would mark the single-sampled resolve destination target as discardable, which may cause rendering regressions on mobile and WebGPU targets that take DONT_CARE literally.\r\n\r\nWhile setting `is_discardable = true (VK_ATTACHMENT_STORE_OP_DONT_CARE)` makes ideal architectural sense for a multisampled attachment to save VRAM bandwidth, leaving it as 'false' ensures that it at least wont crash. \r\n\r\nThere is likely a better solution that preserves the intended optimization while avoiding the NVIDIA specific issue, but identifying that solution would require a deeper understanding of the rendering pipeline and attachment synchronization logic.\r\n\r\n[aftermath-report.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29892710/aftermath-report.zip)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"PateevK","id":171885206,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj7Clg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171885206?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK","html_url":"https://github.com/PateevK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PateevK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121169/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121169/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}